Attribute scores (earned points):
{{$json.attribute_scores}}

Signals:
Sector fit: {{$json.sector_fit_signal}}
Sector fit confidence: {{$json.sector_fit_confidence}}
Revenue AUD: {{$json.stated_revenue_aud}}
Exec sponsor: {{$json.exec_sponsor_signal}}
